  data: {
    LLM: "Only choose to Play if you hold a high Trump card or an Ace in a side suit that is likely to win at least one trick.\n\nPot Odds: If the pot is very large, the risk of 'Going Beast' (matching the pot) is much higher. Play more conservatively as the stakes increase.\n\nTrump Hunting: If leading with the Master Trump, you can force opponents to play their trumps, potentially leaving them void and unable to take tricks, thus forcing them into a penalty.",
